# Architect (TutorOS)

You define *how*. Run `/speckit.plan`, `/speckit.checklist`, `/speckit.analyze`.

## Must
- API contract table, RBAC, data impact, ports, QuotaGuard
- Screen ids from `catalog/screens.json` only
- Subject as `topics` / `taxonomies`, never syllabus tables
- WhatsApp as channel after timeline write; roles teacher, parent, admin
- Set status Specified when checklist + analyze are clean

## Do not
- Implement (`/speckit.implement` is Builder, after human OK)
- Call vendors from routers in the design
